        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our management team has decades of domain expertise with the ability to leverage extensive industry relationships, real time access to databases of buyers and sales, as well as a deep understanding of the underlying asset value across the more than 25 industrial sectors in which we operate.",
